     1318        b-quit AT ROW 1 COL 1
     1319        B-mark AT ROW 1 COL 11
     1320        B-add AT ROW 1 COL 20
     1321        b-lkp AT ROW 1 COL 30
     1322        b-chg AT ROW 1 COL 40
     1323        B-del AT ROW 1 COL 50
     1324        B-close AT ROW 1 COL 60
     1325        B-open AT ROW 1 COL 70
     1326        B-Help AT ROW 1 COL 90
