     1328        b-exp AT ROW 2 COL 30
     1329        B-book AT ROW 2 COL 40
     1330        B-print AT ROW 2 COL 50
     1331        b-hist AT ROW 2 COL 60
     1332        b-sch   AT ROW 2 COL 70
     1333        sel-client at row 3 col 12.5 no-label
     1334        sel-contr at row 3 col 41 no-label
