     1350            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
     1351            TITLE "Список счетов-фактур"
     1352            DEFAULT-BUTTON b-quit CANCEL-BUTTON b-quit.
     1353   ASSIGN
