     1505   ON CHOOSE OF B-del IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1506   DO:
     1507     if not avail buf_schet-fact-doc then return no-apply.
     1508   define variable vss-include-info18 as character format "X(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     1509   do:
